Package: [[package.name]]
Version: [[version]]-[[package.revision]]
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: kura (>= 6.0.0~) | kura-nn (>= 6.0.0~)
Architecture: [[deb.architecture]]
Maintainer: YOFC IoT Edge Team <iot@yofc.com>
Description: YOFC SMART IOT EDGE GATEWAY - OPC-UA client driver add-on
  Provides the OPC-UA client driver bundle (org.eclipse.kura.driver.opcua.provider)
  for the YOFC SMART IOT EDGE GATEWAY. Most installs do not need this — install only
  if the gateway needs to act as an OPC-UA client and pull data from external OPC-UA
  servers. Installs the bundle at /opt/eclipse/kura/plugins/4s/.
Homepage: https://eclipse-kura.github.io/kura/
